# 19TH STREET CURVE AIR: the same on the crest where Market drops from the 19th Street intersection
# (from flat to 12%) into the curve: an ollie at 11 m/s, 0.87 s of air, 500 points.
park sf
spawn valencia_shops
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 0 teleport -1429.4 -368.7 73.75 5.6
cmd 10 set skater.vel.x 1.07
cmd 10 set skater.vel.y 10.95
hold ollie 10..40
run 300
expect event gap{id=curve19th,points=500} within 147..157
expect event comboLanded{name=19TH STREET CURVE AIR,points=500} within 150..165
expect no event bail
